OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785273510
OL,3,CSmuggler jailed after 24 kilos of
OL,4,Cdrugs found in his car
OL,6,FA man who tried to bring nearly
OL,7,F#600,000-worth of cannabis resin into
OL,8,FJersey by hiding it in his car's
OL,9,Fbumpers has been jailed.
OL,11,FAndrew Chard, 39 and from Essex, has
OL,12,Fbeen sentenced to four years and eight
OL,13,Fmonths behind bars by the island's
OL,14,FRoyal Court for importing the Class B
OL,15,Fdrug.
OL,17,FHe was stopped by Jersey Customs and
OL,18,FImmigration Service (JCIS) officers on
OL,19,FMonday 16 March after arriving in St
OL,20,FHelier on a ferry from Portsmouth.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
