OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785273510
OL,3,CSmuggler jailed after 24 kilos of
OL,4,Cdrugs found in his car
OL,6,FTheir search discovered 24 kilograms
OL,7,Fof cannabis resin, hidden in both the
OL,8,Ffront and rear bumpers of Chard's
OL,9,Fvehicle.
OL,11,FAn expert witness deemed the maximum
OL,12,Fstreet value of the cannabis in Jersey
OL,13,Fto be #593,000.
OL,15,FAfter initially not admitting anything
OL,16,Fabout the drugs, evidence was found on
OL,17,FChard's phone that suggested he was
OL,18,Fknowingly involved in importing the
OL,19,Fillegal substance.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1785273510
OL,3,CSmuggler jailed after 24 kilos of
OL,4,Cdrugs found in his car
OL,6,FHe then pleaded guilty during his
OL,7,Ffirst court appearance.
OL,9,FLuke Goddard, JCIS Senior Manager,
OL,10,Fsays: "This is a significant quantity
OL,11,Fof cannabis and the criminals involved
OL,12,Fwould have made a substantial
OL,13,Ffinancial profit.
OL,15,F"This is a great example of the
OL,16,Fdiligence of the JCIS officers
OL,17,Fconcerned in both finding the drugs
OL,18,Fand investigating the offence,
OL,19,Fresulting in the successful conviction
OL,20,Fof the criminal importing the
OL,21,Fcannabis."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
